      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head reveal" style="text-align:center;margin:0 auto;">
          <p class="eyebrow">Before you switch</p>
          <h2>Everything teams ask about the door knocking app.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq reveal" style="margin-top:34px;">
          <details open>
            <summary
              >What is a door knocking app?<span class="plus">+</span></summary
            ><p>
              A door knocking app is field-sales software that maps your
              territory, tracks reps by GPS, and lets them log every door
              (status, notes, and photos) from their phone. Knockio adds
              estimates, e-signatures, and payment so the whole visit lives in
              one place.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary
              >How is "door knocking" different from "canvassing"?<span
                class="plus">+</span
              ></summary
            ><p>
              They're the same motion: going door to door to find and qualify
              leads. "Door knocking" is what reps call the act; "canvassing" is
              what managers call the strategy. Knockio is built for both, and
              for what happens after the knock.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary
              >How fast can we get set up?<span class="plus">+</span></summary
            ><p>
              Most teams are drawing territories and assigning reps within ten
              minutes. Onboarding and data import are free, and support helps
              you move over from spreadsheets or another canvassing app.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary
              >Does it work offline in the field?<span class="plus">+</span
              ></summary
            ><p>
              Yes. Reps can pull up their assigned map and log doors without
              signal; everything syncs the moment they're back online, so no
              knock is lost in a dead zone.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary
              >How is Knockio different from SalesRabbit or SPOTIO?<span
                class="plus">+</span
              ></summary
            ><p>
              SalesRabbit and SPOTIO stop at the knock. Knockio continues
              through estimates, contracts, invoices, and payment, so you don't
              bolt on three more tools to close the jobs your reps open.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Do we own our data?<span class="plus">+</span></summary><p>
              Always. Your territories, leads, and customer history are yours.
              Export them any time, on any plan.
            </p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

